    "introduction": "\" hide memorial summit \" was an outdoor concert held on May 3rd and 4th, 2008, at Tokyo Stadium (Ajinomoto Stadium) in Tokyo. It was held to commemorate the 10th anniversary of the death of hide of X JAPAN.Introducing the memberon guitarforever, hideYoshiki 原计划于 1998 年 9 月为 hide 举办追悼公演，却因失去挚友而痛不欲生，乃至最终无法以最佳状态完成策划，故无限期推迟追悼公演。倏忽十年，Yoshiki 说，当意识到且坚信 hide 依然并将永远存在于他心中时，再也不会害怕了。那么，拾起鼓槌吧！",
